		(property "Note" "Bootstrap diode -- the driver has none built in. Blocks VB, which rides 12 V above a bank node that reaches ~102 V: 200 V class. It charges whenever the bank node swings low: every hold off-time through D_fw, and between injections through the 100k bleed."
